      "english": "Lili: Alright!"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "小何：丽丽，不好意思，公司有急事，我得回去了。",
      "traditional": "小何：麗麗，不好意思，公司有急事，我得回去了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé lì lì bù hǎo yì si gōng sī yǒu jí shì wǒ děi huí qù le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Lili, I'm sorry! There's an urgent matter at work. I have to go back and work."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "simplified": "丽丽：电影才刚开始，你就要走了？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：電影才剛開始，你就要走了？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì diàn yǐng cái gāng kāi shǐ nǐ jiù yào zǒu le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: The movie just started, and you're already leaving?"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "simplified": "小何：对不起！公司有急事，没办法。你自己看吧。",
      "traditional": "小何：對不起！公司有急事，沒辦法。你自己看吧。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé duì bu qǐ gōng sī yǒu jí shì méi bàn fǎ nǐ zì jǐ kàn ba",
      "english": ""
